---
// Sección Puentes Solidarios
---
<section class="py-20 px-4 md:px-8 bg-surface-alt transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">Puentes Solidarios</h2>
    <p class="text-ink-soft mb-12 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">No recibimos. Conectamos. Difundimos causas que alinean con nuestros pilares de Educación Permanente, Conocimiento Libre, Ecología e Infraestructura Comunitaria.</p>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
      <!-- Causa 1: Internet Archive -->
      <a href="https://archive.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group relative block rounded-3xl border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-surface p-6 outline-none transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#E8530E]/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(232,83,14,0.35)]">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1.5 bg-[#E8530E] rounded-l-3xl"></div>
        <img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=archive.org&sz=128" alt="Internet Archive Logo" class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 p-2 object-contain" />
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-3 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#E8530E] uppercase bg-orange-50 dark:bg-orange-900/20 rounded-full">Educación</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors">Internet Archive</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-soft mb-4 text-left">Biblioteca digital universal sin fines de lucro. Acceso libre al conocimiento.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-xs group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Apoyar →</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Causa 2: Wikimedia Foundation -->
      <a href="https://wikimediafoundation.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group relative block rounded-3xl border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-surface p-6 outline-none transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#E8530E]/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(232,83,14,0.35)]">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1.5 bg-[#E8530E] rounded-l-3xl"></div>
        <img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=wikimediafoundation.org&sz=128" alt="Wikimedia Logo" class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 p-2 object-contain" />
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-3 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#E8530E] uppercase bg-orange-50 dark:bg-orange-900/20 rounded-full">Conocimiento Libre</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors">Wikimedia</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-soft mb-4 text-left">Sostén de Wikipedia y proyectos hermanos. Saber libre para toda la humanidad.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-xs group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Apoyar →</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Causa 3: Eden Reforestation -->
      <a href="https://edenprojects.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group relative block rounded-3xl border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-surface p-6 outline-none transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#E8530E]/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(232,83,14,0.35)]">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1.5 bg-[#E8530E] rounded-l-3xl"></div>
        <img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=edenprojects.org&sz=128" alt="Eden Projects Logo" class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 p-2 object-contain" />
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-3 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#E8530E] uppercase bg-orange-50 dark:bg-orange-900/20 rounded-full">Ecológica</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors">Eden Reforestation</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-soft mb-4 text-left">Plantación de árboles y empleo de comunidades locales en países en desarrollo.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-xs group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Apoyar →</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Causa 4: Open Collective -->
      <a href="https://opencollective.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group relative block rounded-3xl border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-surface p-6 outline-none transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#E8530E]/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(232,83,14,0.35)]">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1.5 bg-[#E8530E] rounded-l-3xl"></div>
        <img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=opencollective.com&sz=128" alt="Open Collective Logo" class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 p-2 object-contain" />
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-3 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#E8530E] uppercase bg-orange-50 dark:bg-orange-900/20 rounded-full">Infraestructura</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors">Open Collective</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-soft mb-4 text-left">Plataforma transparente para financiar proyectos de código abierto y comunidades.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-xs group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Apoyar →</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Causa 5: Citizen Spring -->
      <a href="https://citizenspring.earth" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group relative block rounded-3xl border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-surface p-6 outline-none transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#E8530E]/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(232,83,14,0.35)]">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1.5 bg-[#E8530E] rounded-l-3xl"></div>
        <img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=citizenspring.earth&sz=128" alt="Citizen Spring Logo" class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 p-2 object-contain" />
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-3 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#E8530E] uppercase bg-orange-50 dark:bg-orange-900/20 rounded-full">Comunidades</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors">Citizen Spring</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-soft mb-4 text-left">Construyen software libre para reconstruir y empoderar comunidades locales.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-xs group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Apoyar →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>